{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn11le16ob03re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn11le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong notdialogue\">Later that night at the Bistro</span>", "time": "0", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob03re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Rachel, may I have a word?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>:  What? I'm ready to go. It's late.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: We need to talk about your job performance lately.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: I've been working as hard as anyone here. Who works as hard as me?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: This is not a conversation about your work rate, it's about your attitude.\nYour disposition lately has been surly at best.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: My attitude is fine ...\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Your demeanor towards customers and co-workers has become problematic.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: Well, maybe my attitude would change if I didn't have to work in such chaos. Michael earns more than me and he is as disorganized as he is rude.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You are speaking as if you're the manager. Listen! Michael is a bartender and he has his responsibilities.", "time": "100", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob03re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: That's besides the point. I do the work as it should be done, I have worked here longer than anyone and I don't get treated with respect.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You may have worked here a long time and you may have done a good job in the past, but I have recently seen you mistreat customers and tonight I witnessed you disparage and belittle colleagues in front of customers. Then, I noticed someone left the till open behind the bar.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: That was not me! That was Jose!\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Jose might have opened the till, the other bartenders might have done it ... I don't know! But I watched you walk right by it twice and not close it.", "time": "40500", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn11le16ob03re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: I know what is going on here. I am not as silly as you think I am! This is a conspiracy against me.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, Rachel.  I'm afraid I'm going to have to ...\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa Text</span>: \u201cNothing is permanent in this wicked world, not even our troubles.\u201d Charlie Chaplin.  Love Sally.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Rachel. It's later than I thought. Go home get some sleep. We'll talk about this later.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Rachel</span>: But ...\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Rachel. Good night.", "time": "73000", "id": 4}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "questions": [], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about beliefs, opinions, relationships or character traits.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express uncertainty about past events.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can express comparison between two things or events.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What personality traits do you consider to be essential for a manager?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What kind of management skills or techniques do you feel you have?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "